<title>UK: Swissair sets 333.333 mln SFR convertible.</title>
<headline>Swissair sets 333.333 mln SFR convertible.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER    SWISSAIR</p>
<p> AMT 333.333 MLN SFR  COUPON     0.25	MATURITY    08.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE    CONVERTIBLE  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    08.JUL.97</p>
<p> GOV LAW     SWISS    DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NOTES	 CONVERSION PRICE IS 1,596 SFR PER SHARE.</p>
<p>		 NON-CALLABLE FOR TWO YEARS.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
